Licence compatibility
---------------------
The imported decoder explicitly allows GPL-3.0-or-later. MIT, BSD-2-Clause, Apache-2.0 and public-domain
SQLite can be combined with GPLv3. No GPL-2.0-only code has been imported. OozSharp was
not used: its package MIT claim does not remove the GPL notice in its derived decoder,
and its inspected implementation only decodes Mermaid, not the required Kraken streams.
No source with unclear relicensing (such as an MIT-labelled ooz derivation) was imported.
An incompatible licence combination found later must be resolved before merging; this
decision does not grant redistribution rights to game assets, save samples or reference data.
